ich runs in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"JavaScriptCore. It creates HTML or MathML as a string; a web view or browser displays it.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"KaTeX needs no document: translating a formula takes a fraction of a millisecond. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"engine is available on all platforms with JavaScriptCore (every platform but watchOS).","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"KaTeXEngine"}],"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/KaTeXEngine","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"KaTeXEngine"}],"role":"symbol","title":"KaTeXEngine","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/markdownkit/katexengine"},"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/KaTeXOptions":{"abstract":[{"text":"The options for typesetting a formula with KaTeX (see ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/KaTeXEngine","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"). They correspond to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https://katex.org/docs/options","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":". Whatever the options say, KaTeX never","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"creates links or images for the commands ","type":"text"},{"code":"\\href","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"\\url","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"\\includegraphics","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"option ","type":"text"},{"code":"trust","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is always ","type":"text"},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), and it ignores the Unicode characters it does not know","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instead of printing warnings (","type":"text"},{"code":"strict","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"ignore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"KaTeXOptions"}],"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/KaTeXOptions","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"KaTeXOptions"}],"role":"symbol","title":"KaTeXOptions","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/markdownkit/katexoptions"},"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MathAttributedStringGenerator":{"abstract":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/AttributedStringGenerator","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" that shows LaTeX formulas (see ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MathMarkdownParser","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":") as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"images, typeset by ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https://katex.org","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" in a web view. A formula within a line of text","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sits on the baseline of the text, has the colour of the text around it, and is as large as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the text. A formula that is a block of its own is centered in a paragraph.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MathAttributedStringGenerator"}],"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MathAttributedStringGenerator","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MathAttributedStringGenerator"}],"role":"symbol","title":"MathAttributedStringGenerator","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/markdownkit/mathattributedstringgenerator"},"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MathConfig":{"abstract":[{"text":"The configuration for showing formulas as images in attribu